<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Cricket-West Indies v Australia A scoreboard.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Cricket-West Indies v Australia A scoreboard.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard in the limited overs match between Australia A and West Indies at the Melbourne Cricket Ground on Friday.</p>
<p>West Indies 217 for eight, 50 overs</p>
<p>Australia A</p>
<p> M.Slater c Griffith b McLean	     40</p>
<p> M.Hayden run out			     14</p>
<p> M.DiVenuto run out			    2</p>
<p> S.Waugh c Murray b Benjamin		12</p>
<p> D.Lehmann not out			    63</p>
<p> I.Harvey not out			     67</p>
<p> Extras (lb-7 w-3 nb-5)		     20</p>
<p>Total (for four wickets, 44.4 overs)  218</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-34, 2-45, 3-68, 4-86.</p>
<p>Did not bat: A.Gilchrist, G.Foley, A.Bichel, M.Kasprowicz, A.Stuart.</p>
<p>Bowling: Benjamin 9.4-1-29-1 (w-1), Bishop 6-0-21-0 (w-1), Ambrose 8-0-38-0 (nb-2), Hooper 10-1-51-0 (nb-2), McLean 5-0-37-1, Adams 6-0-35-0 (w-1, nb-1).</p>
<p>Result: Australia A won by six wickets.</p>
<p>Note: West Indies bowled five no balls, each worth two runs.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
